  "solution": "**Formula used:**\n\n(A² - B²) = (A - B) × (A + B)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(3.35²-1.25²)/(3.35+1.25)\n\n⇒ {(3.35 - 1.25) × (3.35 + 1.25)}/(3.35 + 1.25)\n\n⇒ (3.35 - 1.25) = 2.10\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 2.10.**",
